<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-aurelia-aurita-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at the Aurelia aurita 201 µm ocellus scale — Code-to-model traceability: 84/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The module docstring states the PDE, the steady state, the Jacobian numbers, k_c, and the 0.0002006 m calibration. Lean declarations name the same discriminant. There is no equation number from Schnakenberg 1979 attached to a line." ;
